@startuml
title Selected Architecture A - atomic manual payment and retry
actor Member
participant "Swing presenter\nbackground worker" as UI
participant "RecordPayment use case" as APP
participant "Domain payment / posting rules" as DOMAIN
database "Local SQLite\nUnitOfWork adapter" as DB
Member -> UI : Record completed settlement P pays Q
UI -> APP : authenticated actor + details + stable operation key
APP -> DB : begin write; load operation key
alt committed matching fingerprint
  DB --> APP : saved result
  APP -> DB : end without new payment/posting
else same key with different fingerprint
  APP -> DB : rollback
  APP --> UI : conflict
else new key
  APP -> DB : claim key; load current membership and pair balance
  APP -> DOMAIN : validate actor/parties/currency/amount/approved policy
  alt invalid or unresolved overpayment branch
    APP -> DB : rollback
    APP --> UI : validation / policy error
  else valid payment
    APP -> DOMAIN : create compensation Q -> P
    APP -> DB : insert Payment + unique settlement posting + audit/result
    alt insert/commit fails
      APP -> DB : rollback complete transaction
      APP --> UI : error or unknown outcome
    else commit succeeds
      APP -> DB : commit
      APP --> UI : saved payment
    end
  end
end
UI --> Member : display on EDT
note over UI, DB
Retry unknown outcomes using original operation key.
Payment P -> Q creates debt posting Q -> P.
A owes B 12; A pays B 5; net debt is 7.
No transfers initiated and no silent deletion/correction.
Financial values are BigDecimal / exact TEXT, never REAL.
end note
@enduml
